{"unit_id":"b14bec01032d69d8d1f1","title":"提案十、 有關降尿酸藥物審查注意事項之審核共識，提請討論。","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":8,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p8-b19","raw_text":"提案十、 有關降尿酸藥物審查注意事項之審核共識，提請討論。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[36.0,692.7996826171875,495.989990234375,710.4674072265625]},{"page":8,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p8-b20","raw_text":"說明: \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[36.0,728.795654296875,76.4939956665039,746.46337890625]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b1","raw_text":"1. Allopurinol 因有造成嚴重藥物過敏反應，即所謂史蒂芬症候群(Stevens \n","start_char":0,"end_char":47,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,44.699623107910156,563.4068603515625,62.36734390258789]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b2","raw_text":"Johnson Syndrome)的風險，讓醫師用藥有所顧忌。因此自103 年3 月\n","start_char":0,"end_char":43,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,80.71964263916016,559.2000122070312,98.38735961914062]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b3","raw_text":"1 日起，已將原治療痛風的第二線藥物Febuxostat（商品名Feburic 80 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":44,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,116.71964263916016,563.429931640625,134.38735961914062]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b4","raw_text":"mg），開放於第一線使用 (附件3 )。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":22,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,152.71963500976562,331.6600036621094,170.38735961914062]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b5","raw_text":"2. 又根據衛福部公告, Benzbromarone 之禁忌症，包括嚴重肝功能不良、 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":44,"bbox":[57.263999938964844,188.71963500976562,563.4299926757812,206.38735961914062]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b6","raw_text":"嚴重腎功能不良、 尿酸性腎臟結石 (附件4 )。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":26,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,224.71963500976562,406.2099914550781,242.38735961914062]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b7","raw_text":"建議： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[36.0,260.7496032714844,88.01399993896484,278.4173278808594]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b8","raw_text":"1. 在兼顧痛風患者用藥安全的考量下，有鑑於肝功能不良是\n","start_char":0,"end_char":29,"bbox":[57.263999938964844,296.52618408203125,483.89337158203125,314.4173278808594]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b9","raw_text":"benzbromarone 藥物的禁忌症，因此建議，開放中重度的慢性腎臟病\n","start_char":0,"end_char":38,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,332.7496032714844,557.0320434570312,350.4173278808594]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b10","raw_text":"(eGFR<45 或 Cr >=1.5)以及肝功能異常(大於兩倍正常值)的痛風病\n","start_char":0,"end_char":41,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,368.7496032714844,548.51171875,386.4173278808594]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b11","raw_text":"人可直接使用Febuxostat。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":19,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,404.7496032714844,275.97998046875,422.4173278808594]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b12","raw_text":"2. 根據台灣痛風與高尿酸血症診療指引，降尿酸藥物於曾經急性痛風關\n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[57.263999938964844,440.54620361328125,559.275146484375,458.4373474121094]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b13","raw_text":"節炎患者，長期終生使用，目標 < 6 mg/dl。 於合併痛風石病患，目\n","start_char":0,"end_char":37,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,476.7696228027344,559.5599975585938,494.4373474121094]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b14","raw_text":"標 < 5 mg/dl。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":14,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,512.7696533203125,192.0800018310547,530.4373779296875]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b15","raw_text":"決議：同意建議事項1、2 點 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":16,"bbox":[36.0,548.7696533203125,239.9600067138672,566.4373779296875]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p9-b16","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,585.4896240234375,39.9900016784668,603.1573486328125]}],"source_quality":[]}